<%- include("templates/header", {
  title: "BeeWilder | Home",
  user: user
}) %>

<main class="home-page" data-page="home">
  <section class="home-hero section-reveal">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="row align-items-center g-4 g-xl-5">
        <div class="col-lg-7">
          <p class="home-kicker">Logged-in field dashboard</p>

          <h1 class="home-title">
            Welcome back to <span>BeeWilder</span>.
          </h1>

          <p class="home-lead">
            Use this dashboard as your base camp. From here, you can scan a
            plant, check your saved discoveries, open the plant map, review the
            encyclopedia, play learning games, or manage your profile and
            settings.
          </p>

          <div class="d-flex flex-column flex-sm-row gap-3 mt-4">
            <a class="btn home-btn-primary btn-lg" href="/plant-scan">
              Scan a plant
            </a>
            <a class="btn home-btn-outline btn-lg" href="/my-plants">
              Open My Plants
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="col-lg-5">
          <aside class="home-field-card tilt-card">
            <div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center mb-3">
              <span class="home-tag">Safety note</span>
              <span class="home-tag home-tag-warning">Required</span>
            </div>

            <h2 class="h4 fw-bold mb-3">
              Always verify before handling or eating plants.
            </h2>

            <p class="mb-4">
              BeeWilder supports learning and decision-making. It should not be
              treated as proof that a wild plant is safe. Compare results with
              field guides, expert advice, and official safety information.
            </p>

            <div class="home-mini-checklist">
              <span>Check confidence level</span>
              <span>Compare lookalikes</span>
              <span>Review season and location</span>
              <span>Save notes before acting</span>
            </div>
          </aside>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="home-section section-reveal" aria-labelledby="quick-actions-title">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="row align-items-end mb-4 g-3">
        <div class="col-lg-7">
          <p class="home-kicker">Quick access</p>
          <h2 id="quick-actions-title" class="home-section-title">
            Choose what you want to do next.
          </h2>
        </div>

        <div class="col-lg-5">
          <p class="home-muted mb-0">
            Each card takes you to one of the main BeeWilder features. The goal
            is to keep users oriented instead of making them hunt through menus.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="row g-4">
        <div class="col-md-6 col-xl-4">
          <a class="home-action-card tilt-card" href="/plant-scan">
            <span class="home-action-icon">📷</span>
            <span class="home-action-label">Plant scan</span>
            <strong>Scan or upload a plant photo</strong>
            <small>
              Review possible matches, confidence guidance, safety warnings,
              lookalike notes, and next steps.
            </small>
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="col-md-6 col-xl-4">
          <a class="home-action-card tilt-card" href="/my-plants">
            <span class="home-action-icon">🌿</span>
            <span class="home-action-label">My Plants</span>
            <strong>Review saved discoveries</strong>
            <small>
              Filter your plant journal by season, location, safety level,
              edible status, or saved scan result.
            </small>
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="col-md-6 col-xl-4">
          <a class="home-action-card tilt-card" href="/plant-map">
            <span class="home-action-icon">🗺️</span>
            <span class="home-action-label">Plant map</span>
            <strong>Explore seasonal sightings</strong>
            <small>
              View nearby plant locations, map pins, seasonal availability, and
              community or database-supported discoveries.
            </small>
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="col-md-6 col-xl-4">
          <a class="home-action-card tilt-card" href="/encyclopedia">
            <span class="home-action-icon">📖</span>
            <span class="home-action-label">Encyclopedia</span>
            <strong>Browse plant profiles</strong>
            <small>
              Learn plant names, traits, seasonality, basic safety notes, and
              details that help you compare scan results.
            </small>
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="col-md-6 col-xl-4">
          <a class="home-action-card tilt-card" href="/plant-game">
            <span class="home-action-icon">🎮</span>
            <span class="home-action-label">Games</span>
            <strong>Practice plant knowledge</strong>
            <small>
              Use quizzes and game-style practice to build confidence with plant
              identification and feature recognition.
            </small>
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="col-md-6 col-xl-4">
          <a class="home-action-card tilt-card" href="/profile">
            <span class="home-action-icon">👤</span>
            <span class="home-action-label">Profile</span>
            <strong>Manage your account</strong>
            <small>
              Update profile information, review saved account details, and
              access settings related to your BeeWilder experience.
            </small>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="home-section home-section-tight section-reveal">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="row g-4">
        <div class="col-lg-5">
          <div class="home-panel h-100">
            <p class="home-kicker">Suggested flow</p>
            <h2 class="home-section-title small-title">
              A safer plant discovery path.
            </h2>
            <p class="home-muted">
              BeeWilder is designed to slow the user down. The app should help
              users compare evidence rather than immediately trust a single
              result.
            </p>
            <a class="btn home-btn-primary" href="/plant-scan">
              Start with a scan
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="col-lg-7">
          <div class="home-timeline">
            <article class="home-timeline-item">
              <span>1</span>
              <div>
                <h3>Scan or upload</h3>
                <p>
                  Begin with an image of a plant, fruit, leaf, or berry you
                  want to learn more about.
                </p>
              </div>
            </article>

            <article class="home-timeline-item">
              <span>2</span>
              <div>
                <h3>Review confidence and warnings</h3>
                <p>
                  Check the possible match, risk notes, and whether lookalikes
                  or preparation concerns are mentioned.
                </p>
              </div>
            </article>

            <article class="home-timeline-item">
              <span>3</span>
              <div>
                <h3>Save, compare, and learn</h3>
                <p>
                  Save discoveries to My Plants, compare with encyclopedia
                  entries, then use games to practice identification.
                </p>
              </div>
            </article>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="home-section section-reveal">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="home-dashboard-grid">
        <article class="home-stat-card">
          <span class="home-stat-number">6</span>
          <span class="home-stat-label">Core destinations</span>
          <p>Scan, map, journal, encyclopedia, games, and profile.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="home-stat-card amber">
          <span class="home-stat-number">4</span>
          <span class="home-stat-label">Safety checks</span>
          <p>Confidence, lookalikes, season, and handling caution.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="home-stat-card sky">
          <span class="home-stat-number">1</span>
          <span class="home-stat-label">Learning loop</span>
          <p>Discover outdoors, save evidence, then practice indoors.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="home-section home-section-tight section-reveal">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="home-cta-panel">
        <div>
          <p class="home-kicker">Ready to continue?</p>
          <h2 class="home-section-title small-title mb-3">
            Keep exploring, but keep safety first.
          </h2>
          <p class="home-muted mb-0">
            Use BeeWilder to organize evidence, not to replace careful judgement.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="home-cta-actions">
          <a class="btn home-btn-primary" href="/plant-scan">Scan plant</a>
          <a class="btn home-btn-outline" href="/settings">Settings</a>
          <a class="btn home-btn-danger" href="/logout">Log out</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>

<%- include("templates/footer") %>
